---
title: IngressRecord · when hack run trusts the record
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> NoRecord
  NoRecord --> Trusted : Write [settled token]
  Trusted --> Trusted : run reads, no Docker call
  Trusted --> Changing : HackBegin [lock free]
  NoRecord --> Changing : HackBegin [lock free]
  Untrusted --> Changing : HackBegin [lock free]
  Changing --> Changing : HackApply
  Changing --> Untrusted : HackEnd
  Untrusted --> Trusted : Write [fresh read]
  Trusted --> NoRecord : Write [container gone]
  note right of Changing
    A crash here leaves the token
    unsettled: every run reads
    Docker until the next change.
    One change at a time: a second
    waits on ingress-change.lock.
  end note
  note right of Trusted
    INV TrustedRecordIsCurrent:
    a trusted record names the
    running address, unless a
    change outside Hack followed.
  end note
  classDef ok stroke-width:1.6px
  classDef wait stroke-width:1.6px
  classDef idle stroke-dasharray:4 3
  class Trusted ok
  class Changing wait
  class Untrusted,NoRecord idle
